{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】「SEGA／ATLUS」攤位報導！「女神異聞錄4 Revival」試玩與Ado的語音訊息等</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/56aefae58e0f0fddbb37f7e189d6517a9f71c043e9310a5289b4a2ac721a3c8f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F42c276a73d19d7f7b7e032744a03447b.png\"/><p>2026年9月17日(四)～20日(日)4天期間舉辦的遊戲慶典「 東京電玩展2026 (以下稱TGS2026)」 這次要報導「 SEGA／ATLUS 」攤位！</p><h3>報導「SEGA／ATLUS」攤位！</h3><p>SEGA攤位索尼克登場！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b9ca7a30557bf4a94342c4bba164c02adc50ebd19827e7a5626d0e2308a243e7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fedcd70f86f6a6200ece4b6d0a4290900.png\"/><p>潛入TGS常客企業之一的「SEGA／ATLUS」攤位！ 馬上就由SEGA招牌的刺蝟索尼克來迎接我們。</p><p>「女神異聞錄4 Revival」區</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/04522ee364b3fabdfc7c4894fb6e03adf4f476ae41e7242ca0d4d22228bea75e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0aadcf9801d4653f2027f736042b3949.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/82777051e9646fc37fe872771d5f3fe919592165028cb3f27a2841b693acbe6c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb0d15c6ba329259f0e883cbe5d586c68.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7e7da6349b2df08ac83a47496fb08484e53d64eb578d67061689870e54286927/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe6ab965224155422bdbe587d98ebf8f4.png\"/><p>SEGA／ATLUS攤位中格外盛況空前的，是「 女神異聞錄4 Revival 」區。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c9d3a0ec3ad21cb043021722b549e8fad5b49b167ae54a4337cea15ecc071cab/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa9505a5961a6d07e30dd853f46f52489.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/17f338b0371e182a66ba3cbe7c9d834c3e0ffc6810b0d32718ac3a76e5e16515/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe10245dce34744439de7a84026706003.png\"/><p>當然可以試玩遊戲。 還準備了眾多拍照景點與展示螢幕，是非常投入的區域。</p><p>指著比姿勢！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9a72e577afd410295e99492d5941010c6aa11b6650b4b2402fea1fa418879a02/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fef8cdfefb40f40f0004298266e3bc9d9.png\"/><p>宣傳小姐也完全融入角色，還看向鏡頭。 謝謝！</p><p>懸吊在半空中顯眼的索尼克氣球</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/56e4ceacf4295bda464ef15272b4c7192b1d172e4c02a3e00d82e0f06846e201/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fbed20eaeb997fc432b48b21c752ea501.jpg\"/><p>接著是「 索尼克賽車 交叉世界 」區。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/16587a0867405da2c928ea5b5369ba719242055823745ad8fc7feba055ce8344/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7d7ed9b82fad5d8d99a3cf4646fa63cd.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/83d6a9d9a0263be5d79cf0d5af71902fb37ca06a4c4625489d19c305c29c6efa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa4b5f8496ebcf2150926ba2f70c46832.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1ba629cce1ecb77ba6d4a6fecd01b92a7af656524b4ec034776d8eb0835e903a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd6a42403297a29318a9e65fd2f9a2932.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d2f6a66ff982bd997c6021e760a5cfb22eb1a85facff1743693238470eeec03f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F21c4555a2c8a58397ff5cf1081ce5767.jpg\"/><p>在索尼克的遊戲展示中，誰會預想到會看到新世紀福音戰士或哥斯拉的身影呢。 因為已決定聯名，因此大力宣傳。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/40fd75c084d9332d8d338109ad45eae411bfd3f80e9fe19a57607a9845a29529/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F09dd7d9a30fc086ff5be095d11d9b1c8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8f1163afd2e1ca25f85d9b81a3f35ee50593cc4f2179d678fcebcac190d6c957/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff2d2f74e18ac128b1b9010e5bd45b775.jpg\"/><p>雖然也能試玩遊戲，但能玩的是為TGS2026準備的縱向螢幕版本。 或許是第一次看到用縱向螢幕遊玩家用遊戲。 筆者也試玩了，但由於能清楚看見通常遊玩時無法確認的背景等，沉浸感非常驚人。</p><p>展出30款以上遊戲！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e0baeda17cc8ba1ad329e252b20e1d17080b783b5fdc61e6c39b989bf2ade361/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F548a9fbfee2d8d682112ba092de36a81.jpg\"/><p>接著是SEGA Partners區。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/86f1c9c06dca2cdbd85031313b4bb907393dafae3065231ace941853dcc69df8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F50b9ae56bbbb1db87dedcee056c46c7a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6cfe3348d9a2dae25c439848c16228824e650f03459c576378767c46c6c7abcb/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffc386d9b309215bfdfebaeefad9063b7.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c391ac1f7dedd9c9b168bbffda7fc168b7b31213b550d5546a248854a57fcf6f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8bb2dc4a96f478189904c83af59fb1f5.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/90d8defe84d1db636f260eb7b0e0c0da565aed418e065fff16c1ef4b43815db6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc899ce6d00f52f84c26e40df45cfcd15.png\"/><p>這個區域真的展出了非常多遊戲。 而且其中大多可以試玩，宣傳小姐也排排站。 這才是TGS！這才是實體活動！感受到這樣的氣氛，真是太棒了。</p><p>相隔原版約15年、相隔重製版約3年的新作</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1396083ecf1b06ecba6ef4a2c1ad7e9a086e0a04d61c4b79e7aaca478b50b88f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa9d291b5c3870d0a973487644af336b7.jpg\"/><p>其中，形成長長等候隊伍的，是「 電鋸甜心 2 Back2Back 」區。 由於才剛在TGS2026發表的作品可以試玩，吸引了許多人聚集。</p><p>沒有電鋸！？</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8f4f67be93159e599b0a187adfa2f3d383027655284c62ad09d04dcef6f46048/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F39fd39880f9d562df3e12ccc40abd54c.jpg\"/><p>這個區域也成為拍照景點，可與拿著實物大小電鋸的茱麗葉一起拍照。 通常是與立牌並排拍攝，但是・・・。</p><p>PeachMilky小姐扮演的茱麗葉</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8bb06e2e54af0d1ca10ce680a605cf481cf1a2356a50446c0d7bc8e345851c68/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa39380232a7b437b09e3c2702706e0d6.jpg\"/><p>時機好的話，茱麗葉與殭屍的角色扮演者會出現，也會舉辦拍立得攝影會。</p><p>扮演茱麗葉的，是人氣角色扮演者兼模特兒的PeachMilky( @PeachMilky_ )小姐。 其高品質與模特兒出身的美貌，讓拍攝中不禁表情僵硬的人接連出現，存在感十足。</p><p>雖然是這副模樣，但拜託的話也會擺姿勢</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/09fa85236c733d8c197bdc8525b87974e048e057a8ddc747e3ba6381fc6cdd9a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6fa4bff282acc32c96ed157e4915240e.jpg\"/><p>雖然容易將目光放在茱麗葉身上，但飾演殭屍的人也像遊戲中一樣，搖搖晃晃地走、眼神無法對焦，簡直像從畫面中走出來一樣。 幸好沒被咬・・・。</p><p>「STRANGER THAN HEAVEN」漫步博物館</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5435d527fe46a0e8f8ea6e9a40d6f9cd90aada07569ff2574a5054f26b94c4f4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe868dcc4468c94c08a5d90cef61a4a96.png\"/><p>而SEGA／ATLUS攤位中感覺面積最大的，是「 STRANGER THAN HEAVEN (異於天堂)」區。 與試玩區分開，展示了漫步博物館。</p><p>眾多主視覺圖</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/ee83e54011c50ac6ec6733b57694cf138c2a5d603aa566fb658d2c87c4c1127f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fff6e6e56bde5b68dbb71dbf319411eed.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4944e6dffda9758f8320b54db0762358b5b06cb34b2ef8c32f01ad9ac80e4d99/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Feaa18c3af2a7e0291dad1c35cf02deda.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/025d9a7f461fa26df5758345edc2028db4fa3ed76d36eb0e960d1ab7235fb822/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffe53face45974ffece60886faa4da859.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/90d24246468d054ae45cda5661a0237e50700778b4ce73ef1262a3d9ad8d8691/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fafee96ba050ee3f8865667d1c01bab95.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/78cf02ce6faf051845e4e429b17311d5a726ae0f237566d258bd6ec2ec885e90/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff97e2163f5874071ceb29ba85e2ce714.jpg\"/><p>由於也有禁止拍攝的部分，照片僅摘錄一部分，但內部盡是相關人士訪談影片等、提升對發售期待的內容。 尤其是被大拔擢為聲優的Ado( @ado1024imokenp )小姐的語音訊息，讓許多人停下腳步傾聽。</p><p>以上，就是SEGA／ATLUS攤位！</p><p>🔸【TGS2026】「DMM GAMES」展位報導！「Dot Abyss」與「Muv-Luv Girls Garden」參展！ 🔸【TGS2026】「Minecraft」攤位報導！體驗新作《Minecraft Dungeons II》以及挑戰擊敗巨大苦力怕的遊樂設施等 🔸【TGS2026】「Mouse Computer」展位報導！NEXTGEAR 新產品與 G TUNE 試玩機台登場 🔸【TGS2026】將人類3D化放進手機！？能體驗次世代內容生成的「KDDI」攤位報導！ 🔸【TGS2026】「集英社遊戲」攤位報導！「咒術迴戰激鬥: 倖存潮汐」與「UN:Me 非我:擇誰」大排長龍</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T06:20:27.402811+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1517,"images":30,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}